# This repo is served directly by GitHub Pages, so anything committed here
# is public. Keep local tooling output out of it.

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/

# Agent tooling. This lives in the project folder on purpose — the work moves
# between computers on an external drive, so config that isn't here isn't there
# either. It is ignored rather than committed because this repo is public and
# Pages-served: committing it would publish local settings and working notes.
.claude/

# Local tooling only. package.json and package-lock.json ARE committed so the
# toolchain is reproducible on the next machine; the installed tree is not.
node_modules/
